ent £1m of mother's fortune; court orders £2.6M recovery]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135980243.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-british-woman-used-more-than-1-million-of-her-elderly-mothers-money-for-holidays-cars-shopping-and-a-lavish-wedding-high-court-ordered-her-to-hand-back-2-6-million-after-a-bitter-inheritance-battle/articleshow/135980243.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-british-woman-used-more-than-1-million-of-her-elderly-mothers-money-for-holidays-cars-shopping-and-a-lavish-wedding-high-court-ordered-her-to-hand-back-2-6-million-after-a-bitter-inheritance-battle/articleshow/135980243.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T12:14:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135980330,imgsize-1184010.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Derbyshire man buries £4,000 Boeing 737 to build underground party bunker]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135977258.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/derbyshire-man-buys-a-boeing-737-for-4000-on-facebook-and-buries-it-beneath-his-garden-to-build-an-underground-party-bunker-inspired-by-the-great-escape/articleshow/135977258.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/derbyshire-man-buys-a-boeing-737-for-4000-on-facebook-and-buries-it-beneath-his-garden-to-build-an-underground-party-bunker-inspired-by-the-great-escape/articleshow/135977258.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T12:03:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135977329,imgsize-1761663.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Music Centre Opens To Public: Monmouth unveils Springsteen archive; spans American music history]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135952938.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scheduled to launch on June 13, 2026, the Bruce Springsteen Center for American Music at Monmouth University aspires to uphold America's musical legacy and accentuate the cultural impact of music in the nation. The center will showcase a remarkable collection of over 48,000 artifacts, including items from Springsteen and other legends.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bruce-springsteens-archive-began-as-a-fan-collection-in-2001-25-years-later-a-50-million-32000-square-foot-new-jersey-music-centre-is-open-to-the-public-and-preserves-more-than-48000-items/articleshow/135952938.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bruce-springsteens-archive-began-as-a-fan-collection-in-2001-25-years-later-a-50-million-32000-square-foot-new-jersey-music-centre-is-open-to-the-public-and-preserves-more-than-48000-items/articleshow/135952938.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T12:00:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135953245,imgsize-1100856.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kandinsky painting sells for record $85.8 million, nearly doubling artist's previous auction high]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135977844.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Wassily Kandinsky’s painting Betonte Ecken achieved a record-breaking price of $85.8 million at Christie’s New York. The auction event generated a total of $627 million and included numerous notable artworks. Competitive bidding was evident, with multiple collectors participating for high-value pieces. Other artists like Gustav Klimt and Pablo Picasso also saw substantial sales. The results indicate a vibrant market for modern and Impressionist art continues to thrive.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/wassily-kandinskys-painting-betonte-ecken-sold-for-85-8-million-at-a-november-17-new-york-auction-almost-doubling-the-artists-previous-44-8-million-record-as-christies-evening-sale-brought-in-627-million/articleshow/135977844.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/wassily-kandinskys-painting-betonte-ecken-sold-for-85-8-million-at-a-november-17-new-york-auction-almost-doubling-the-artists-previous-44-8-million-record-as-christies-evening-sale-brought-in-627-million/articleshow/135977844.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T12:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135977970,imgsize-70161.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Elton John's public railway station piano heads to auction for AIDS charity, estimated at £250,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135976337.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Elton John's iconic Yamaha piano, which has graced St Pancras International since 2016, is set to be auctioned soon to support the Elton John AIDS Foundation in honor of World AIDS Day. This rare item not only represents a significant moment in British music history but also offers bidders a chance to contribute to a vital cause.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-2016-elton-john-gave-a-piano-to-a-london-railway-station-for-anyone-to-play-10-years-later-the-instrument-is-going-to-auction-with-an-estimate-of-120000-to-250000-to-benefit-his-aids-foundation/articleshow/135976337.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-2016-elton-john-gave-a-piano-to-a-london-railway-station-for-anyone-to-play-10-years-later-the-instrument-is-going-to-auction-with-an-estimate-of-120000-to-250000-to-benefit-his-aids-foundation/articleshow/135976337.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T11:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135976421,imgsize-37613.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Oceanwide Plaza Revival: 250 Balconies Cleared; $850 million plan awaits financing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135874848.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In downtown Los Angeles, the partially completed Oceanwide Plaza is getting a makeover as graffiti is being removed. With $850 million pledged by KPC Group and Lendlease, this project is set to offer luxury residences, a hotel, and retail spaces. Positioned as a key component of the city's strategy to uplift the downtown area for the 2028 Summer Olympics, community engagement will be central to these revitalization efforts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/los-angeles-abandoned-1-2-billion-oceanwide-plaza-towers-became-covered-in-graffiti-after-construction-stopped-in-2019-crews-have-now-cleaned-about-250-balconies-as-buyers-plan-an-850-million-revival/articleshow/135874848.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/los-angeles-abandoned-1-2-billion-oceanwide-plaza-towers-became-covered-in-graffiti-after-construction-stopped-in-2019-crews-have-now-cleaned-about-250-balconies-as-buyers-plan-an-850-million-revival/articleshow/135874848.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:56:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135951976,imgsize-140256.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tasmania Wilderness Rescue: Beacon Helps Locate Two Hikers; police urge hikers to carry safety gear]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135951007.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In Tasmania, two bushwalkers found themselves in a perilous situation due to unexpected weather changes, prompting them to activate their personal locator beacon for assistance. While emergency services launched a rescue mission, harsh conditions hindered helicopter access, leading a search-and-rescue team to trek through difficult landscapes to reach the hikers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/two-women-from-south-australia-activated-a-satellite-emergency-device-after-encountering-difficult-conditions-on-tasmanias-western-arthur-range-a-rescue-team-had-to-walk-in-as-helicopter-could-not-reach/articleshow/135951007.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/two-women-from-south-australia-activated-a-satellite-emergency-device-after-encountering-difficult-conditions-on-tasmanias-western-arthur-range-a-rescue-team-had-to-walk-in-as-helicopter-could-not-reach/articleshow/135951007.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:56:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135951183,imgsize-176685.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NASA maps show 2026 El Niño resembles 1997; NOAA sees 83% chance of strong conditions in 2027]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135911172.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Recent satellite observations reveal striking similarities between the anticipated 2026 El Niño and the notorious 1997 event. Elevated sea levels across the Pacific are raising alarm among scientists regarding its expected severity. This climatic shift could drastically alter global weather patterns, with countries like India potentially facing erratic monsoon conditions. Experts estimate an 83% likelihood of heightened intensity in early 2027, posing significant risks for various regions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/nasa-satellite-maps-show-the-2026-el-nios-pacific-bulge-lining-up-with-october-1997-the-event-blamed-for-5-7-trillion-in-losses-nasas-josh-willis-says-this-one-is-on-track-to-be-even-bigger/articleshow/135911172.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/nasa-satellite-maps-show-the-2026-el-nios-pacific-bulge-lining-up-with-october-1997-the-event-blamed-for-5-7-trillion-in-losses-nasas-josh-willis-says-this-one-is-on-track-to-be-even-bigger/articleshow/135911172.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:56:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135911544,imgsize-177854.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[London woman wins £20,000 legal costs after neighbours force garden gate twice]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135978054.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-london-woman-took-her-neighbours-to-court-after-they-allegedly-forced-her-garden-gate-twice-and-changed-its-lock-a-judge-ordered-a-father-and-son-to-pay-20000-in-legal-costs/articleshow/135978054.cms]]></link><guid><![