articleshow/135978145.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hindu-temple-attack-plot-illinois-man-indicted-on-multiple-terrorism-charges/articleshow/135978145.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:35:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135978217,imgsize-1117217.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Alex Trebek's former 578-acre California winery ranch heads to December auction]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135962172.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Creston Manor, a majestic estate formerly belonging to Alex Trebek, is now up for auction following an unsuccessful private sale. Spanning an impressive 577 acres, this property boasts vineyards and various residences alongside agricultural ventures. Initially listed at $7 million, the price has been lowered, with online bidding commencing on December 4, leading to a live auction later that month.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-1987-jeopardy-host-alex-trebek-became-a-partner-in-a-california-winery-on-a-nearly-578-acre-ranch-after-a-6-45-million-listing-failed-to-find-a-buyer-the-historic-property-is-heading-to-a-december-auction/articleshow/135962172.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-1987-jeopardy-host-alex-trebek-became-a-partner-in-a-california-winery-on-a-nearly-578-acre-ranch-after-a-6-45-million-listing-failed-to-find-a-buyer-the-historic-property-is-heading-to-a-december-auction/articleshow/135962172.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135962303,imgsize-693633.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A great horned owl in Pennsylvania survived being struck by a tractor-trailer travelling at 65 mph]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135964664.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In an incredible tale of survival, a great horned owl in Pennsylvania endured a harrowing journey after being struck by a truck and wedged in its air dam. Traveling roughly 70 miles, the owl was finally found by trucking terminal employees. Despite sustaining an eye injury, it was otherwise unharmed.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-great-horned-owl-survived-being-struck-by-a-tractor-trailer-travelling-at-65-mph-then-remained-trapped-in-its-front-air-dam-for-about-70-miles-before-pennsylvania-rescuers-freed-it-with-few-injuries/articleshow/135964664.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-great-horned-owl-survived-being-struck-by-a-tractor-trailer-travelling-at-65-mph-then-remained-trapped-in-its-front-air-dam-for-about-70-miles-before-pennsylvania-rescuers-freed-it-with-few-injuries/articleshow/135964664.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:08:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135964805,imgsize-958152.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Metal detectorist Daniel Crowe found a Viking hoard on the Isle of Man]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135964307.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Daniel Crowe made an astonishing discovery of a Viking hoard on the Isle of Man, revealing a trove of jewellery and weapons that shed light on the social hierarchy and burial customs of the early Viking Age. This remarkable collection offers crucial insights into the roles women played in Viking society, with artefacts showcasing intricate designs and suggesting links to extensive trading networks across the British Isles.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/metal-detectorist-daniel-crowe-found-a-viking-hoard-on-the-isle-of-man-including-a-sword-3-bronze-brooches-and-trading-scales-from-around-ad-900-it-has-now-gone-on-display-at-manx-museum/articleshow/135964307.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/metal-detectorist-daniel-crowe-found-a-viking-hoard-on-the-isle-of-man-including-a-sword-3-bronze-brooches-and-trading-scales-from-around-ad-900-it-has-now-gone-on-display-at-manx-museum/articleshow/135964307.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:06:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135964395,imgsize-95226.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Researchers discovered a new scorpion species in Odisha's Similipal Tiger Reserve]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135861452.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A newly documented scorpion species has been unveiled, representing the first instance of Liocheles in Odisha. Researchers designated this species as Liocheles similipalensis following an in-depth analysis of its physical traits. With this addition, the total number of recognized Liocheles species globally rises to seven, and four of these have been discovered in India.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/researchers-discovered-a-new-scorpion-species-in-odishas-similipal-tiger-reserve-the-5-cm-bluish-black-creature-is-the-first-recorded-member-of-its-genus-in-the-state/articleshow/135861452.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/researchers-discovered-a-new-scorpion-species-in-odishas-similipal-tiger-reserve-the-5-cm-bluish-black-creature-is-the-first-recorded-member-of-its-genus-in-the-state/articleshow/135861452.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:06:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135861452,imgsize-179300.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hong Kong Case Dropped: Prosecutors cite unreachable witnesses; captain faces deportation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135977493.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Hong Kong authorities have chosen to drop the prosecution against Captain Wan Wenguo for the Balticconnector gas pipeline damage, citing challenges in reaching essential witnesses from mainland China. Although he pleaded not guilty, Captain Wan accepted responsibility for safety violations. Evidence connected his vessel to the pipeline incident, leading to expectations of his deportation to mainland China.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/hong-kong-ends-case-against-captain-accused-of-damaging-baltic-gas-pipeline/articleshow/135977493.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/hong-kong-ends-case-against-captain-accused-of-damaging-baltic-gas-pipeline/articleshow/135977493.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:05:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135977653,imgsize-94715.cms"/></item></channel></rss>